---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import ServicePage from "../components/ServicePage.astro";
import ContactCta from "../components/ContactCta.astro";

const latestMix = "https://www.mixcloud.com/djrachellynch/dj-rachel-wedding-reception-rewind-edm-festival-vibes-2hrs/";
const publicMixPath = "/djrachellynch/dj-rachel-wedding-reception-rewind-meredith-caleb-part-1/";
const publicMix = `https://www.mixcloud.com${publicMixPath}`;
const mixPlayer = `https://www.mixcloud.com/widget/iframe/?hide_cover=1&light=1&feed=${encodeURIComponent(publicMixPath)}`;
---

<SiteLayout title="Connecticut Wedding DJ & MC | DJ Rachel Lynch" description="Plan a wedding soundtrack that feels like you with DJ Rachel Lynch. Wedding DJ and MC services, ceremony audio, and thoughtful event coordination.">
	<ServicePage
		eyebrow="Wedding DJ + MC"
		title="your love story,<br /><em>your vibe,</em><br />your way."
		lead="No cookie-cutter playlist here. Plan your music and moments in your personalized wedding app. Then, when your wedding day finally arrives, soak in every second. I've got the rest."
		offersHeading="everything your celebration needs"
		weddingHero
		highlightOffers
		offers={[
			{ title: "Ceremony", copy: "Every vow heard. Thoughtfully coordinated music and microphone cues for every important moment. Microphones and music for the moments that matter most." },
			{ title: "Cocktail hour", copy: "A personalized soundtrack that sets the tone, leaves room to talk, and builds toward the night ahead." },
			{ title: "Reception + dance floor", copy: "This is the part everyone talks about the next day. Your favorite songs, performed like you've never heard them. Your people. Your energy. Smiles and hands in the air all night. From the classics everyone knows to the songs your friends can't resist, the dance floor becomes a celebration of your people." },
			{ title: "MC + timeline", copy: "A warm, friendly voice on the mic. Every key moment seamlessly coordinated with your vendor team. A day that feels effortless, whatever happens behind the scenes. Your timeline is in good hands." },
		]}
		steps={[]}
	>
		<section slot="after-hero" class="section page-width wedding-story" aria-labelledby="wedding-story-heading">
			<h2 id="wedding-story-heading">More than music.<br /><em>More than a great party.</em></h2>
			<div class="wedding-story__copy">
				<p>Your wedding is one of the few occasions when all your favorite people come together in one place. Every detail, every moment, and every song should feel like it belongs to you.</p>
				<p>My job goes far beyond keeping the dance floor full. It's understanding the people, personalities, and priorities that make your celebration uniquely yours.</p>
				<p>From helping you plan the flow of the evening to coordinating with your vendor team, hosting your guests, and knowing when to turn up the energy or let a moment breathe, I'm there to make sure everything comes together.</p>
				<p><strong>And when plans change? I adapt.</strong></p>
				<p>Because you should spend your wedding celebrating, not worrying about what's happening behind the scenes.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section slot="planning" class="app-planning" aria-labelledby="app-planning-heading">
			<div class="page-width">
				<h2 id="app-planning-heading">Plan the whole celebration from your phone. <em>No, seriously.</em></h2>
				<div class="app-planning__grid">
					<div>
						<p>No spreadsheets. No PDFs. Just a modern app that walks you through the music, timeline, and big moments for your event. A few taps and you’re on your way.</p>
						<p>Pull in songs from Spotify or Apple Music, mark your must-plays and hard passes, and leave me a note like “play <em>this</em> version for our entrance.” Want your guests to weigh in? Invite them to suggest songs while keeping the rest of your plans private.</p>
						<p>When the party starts, I’ve got your picks, cues, and details in one place. If a detail matters to you, it matters to me, too. Planning with your DJ should feel effortless. You’ve already got a day job.</p>
					</div>
					<figure class="app-video">
						<figcaption id="app-video-label">See how the app works</figcaption>
						<video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="/wedding-app-walkthrough-poster.jpg" width="1280" height="720" aria-labelledby="app-video-label">
							<source src="/wedding-app-walkthrough.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
							<p>Your browser doesn’t support embedded video. <a href="/wedding-app-walkthrough.mp4">Watch the app walkthrough</a>.</p>
						</video>
					</figure>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="mix-sample" aria-labelledby="wedding-mix">
			<div class="page-width media-section">
				<div>
					<p class="eyebrow">On Mixcloud</p>
					<h2 id="wedding-mix">Hear a <em>real wedding</em> set.</h2>
					<p>Press play for a set from Meredith and Caleb’s reception.</p>
					<a class="wedding-mix-link" href={latestMix}>Latest wedding mix · EDM Festival Vibes</a>
				</div>
				<div class="wedding-mix-player">
					<iframe
						src={mixPlayer}
						title="Mixcloud player for Meredith and Caleb’s wedding reception mix"
						height="120"
						loading="lazy"
						allow="autoplay"
					></iframe>
					<a class="wedding-mix-link" href={publicMix}>Open Meredith and Caleb’s mix on Mixcloud</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<ContactCta />
	</ServicePage>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
	.wedding-story { padding-top: 20px; }
	.wedding-story h2 { text-transform: none; }
	.wedding-story__copy { max-width: 780px; margin-top: 32px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; }

	.app-planning { background: #000; color: #fff; padding-block: 80px; }
	.app-planning h2 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.5vw, 5.5rem); font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 36px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
	.app-planning__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 40px; }
	.app-planning__grid p { line-height: 1.8; }
	.app-video { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
	.app-video figcaption { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
	.app-video video { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border: 4px solid var(--pink); background: #000; }
	@media (max-width: 760px) { .app-planning__grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 24px; } }

	.mix-sample {
		padding-block: 0;
	}

	.wedding-mix-player {
		display: grid;
		gap: 12px;
	}

	.wedding-mix-player iframe {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		border: 0;
	}

	.wedding-mix-link {
		color: inherit;
		text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
	}

</style>
